### Migrate Path to Tauri Manager

The Rust `tauri::api::path` module functions and `tauri::PathResolver` have been moved to `tauri::Manager::path`:

```rust
use tauri::{path::BaseDirectory, Manager};

tauri::Builder::default()
    .setup(|app| {
